	(text "External Waveshare 6\" HD IT8951 HAT on a 1x8 2.54mm header (same signals the Disco\nwiring uses today). 33R series on the MCU-driven SPI lines (edge damping over the\ncable). The HAT gets +5V only while EPD_5V_EN is high: FIRMWARE MUST drive SCK/MOSI/\nCS/RST low (or float them) while the HAT is unpowered, or it back-powers the IT8951\nthrough its I/O clamp diodes."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "73877b11-b4bb-51c5-9ddf-00341f5d12b1")
	)
