	(text "CAP1188 cap-touch on I2C1. ADDR_COMM 150k -> SMBus address 0x29 (0101_001), same as\nthe Adafruit breakout used for bring-up. SPI_CS# to GND (I2C mode), WAKE 100k\npull-down, RESET (active high) 100k pull-down, ALERT# open-drain 10k pull-up, unused\nLED1-8 and unused CS inputs to GND (datasheet Table 1.1). Electrodes: left pair on\nCS3/CS4 (top side, away from VDD), right pair on CS5/CS6 (right side, towards J303) -\nchosen for layout: CS1-4 all on the top side fenced in the VDD pin. Two small electrode\nboards on short JST-SH cables (touch / GND / touch). Geometry: hardware/enclosure."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 132.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "99d6fa57-3beb-5ec2-9988-19a03ec8501d")
	)
